n and off the cop went to take chase. He got what he deserved I guess.... All I know is chalk another rice kill up to the FIERO!  <P>------------------<BR>'86 fiero Se<BR>    Todd<BR>NO MR. RICER STICKERS DON'T MAKE YOU FASTER!!!||||reg||6
